[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
sysmanage-canary is installed but NOT configured.

1. Edit %%PREFIX%%/etc/sysmanage-canary.yaml: the server URLs, the
   database role (read-only is enough), the mail server and who to alert.
   The file holds passwords, so it is mode 0600, owned by sysmanage-canary;
   keep it that way.

2. Check it and send a test message:

     sysmanage-canary --config %%PREFIX%%/etc/sysmanage-canary.yaml --check-config
     sysmanage-canary --config %%PREFIX%%/etc/sysmanage-canary.yaml --test-email

3. Enable and start it:

     sysrc sysmanage_canary_enable=YES
     service sysmanage_canary start

It logs to syslog with the tag sysmanage-canary.
EOM
}
]
